            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka doŋ gutyeko nina magi abiro, ci doŋ cakke i nino me aborone cito kwede anyim, ajwagi gibityero gitum awaŋawu ki gityer lakwecwiny i kom ke no tyer, ci an abigamowu, An Rwot Lubaŋa doŋ atyeko loko man.”",
